. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Te_RvjexFI4Q7kNvwFtHcI8&_nc_oc=AdlYb9YGN8BofeRzDddIneLmkMy4r1bgDAo5aCupuEzO4qgf19YeNwq2H-LeaNnJs7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyccsf_rQGgpLxONCaIUUe97mlXoEa4TxvIKAHrl_VKRA&oe=69AC21BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cUa6GbmQDCoQ7kNvwGsH6qO&_nc_oc=AdnH4sIgWAhgILGACIyZEwuB6CqLApqfZprkZr8K16x20mkxmdDri4DyRRszIunqajI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwjfpOoM-z4AsAd4J015VXBmy9Cd4hMVbe-Imuad-HUwA&oe=69AC385E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h1E6Jkd_zZUQ7kNvwGvq15S&_nc_oc=Adm2ohZD9qRnXHUeTrXKygvkBflmsnOe2DCPxCxwhaBUm-j1xrooga9at2lKC1WRBPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyafux-ytDDuV3IAP5lCyLx4n2c1jHb2rCBexBFazPDKg&oe=69AC2DDB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1